  <!--
    ARM and x86 configurations, mirroring every other library in this solution.
    The solution maps its Debug|ARM (and Debug|x86) onto these projects, so
    without a matching Condition there is no OutputPath for that pair and
    Microsoft.Common.CurrentVersion.targets fails the whole build with
    "The OutputPath property is not set for project". Only the Debug pairs carry
    a Build.0 line in BrowserForWP.sln, so Release never builds for the tests.
  -->
